notes.content:
Dear Player,

We are excited to announce that the Xmas Event has just begun and will last till January 6th.

During this period you may collect candies to obtain tons of free coins and powerful rewards.

You may find the Xmas quests in the achievement screen:

Candies for gold - collect 500 candies to get 1000 coins;
Xmas Gift - collect 3000 candies to obtain the "Santa's Golden Bracelet";
The Coins Multiplier - Transform into snowmen and kill 100 players to collect triple coins for 24hrs;
Candies for Snowballs - Collect 25 candies to get a Snowball Launcher;
Crushing Snowmen - Kill 10 snowmen to get a powerful device;
Xmas Chest - Collect 12 xmas skins to get a Sapphire Chest.


Santa's Golden Bracelet: Agility 9%, Virus 15%, Eat Distance 9%, Fatigue Resistance 9%, Thinness 9%

During all the Xmas event every purchase gets double coins!

Thank you for playing Worm.is and
Merry Christmas and Happy New Year!

Worm.is Staff
